  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">TKM_National Inventory of banks of used or unwanted substances and a plan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project Proposal for Turkmenistan aims at the preparation of national inventories of banks of waste-controlled substances and n ational plans for the environmentally sound management of the substances, stipulated in the documents UNEP/OzL.Pro/ExCom/91/66. The Project activities are related to undertaking an inventory of banks of used or unwanted controlled substances together with the development of a plan for their collection, transport, and disposal, including consideration of recycling, reclamation, and cost-effective destruction of such substances.</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org role="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Montreal Protocol</narrative>
  </participating-org>
